#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_StevensHouse/scripts.inc:150
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_StevensHouse_Text_YouveEarnedHMDive"
msgid ""
"STEVEN: {PLAYER}{KUN}…\p"
"As you can see, there's not much here,\n"
"but this is my home.\p"
"Thank you for all that you've done.\p"
"This is my token of appreciation.\n"
"It's the HIDDEN MACHINE DIVE.\p"
"No need to be shy--you've earned\n"
"this HM.$"
msgstr ""
"大吾：{PLAYER}{KUN}……\p"
"如你所见，这里没什么东西，\n"
"不过这就是我的家。\p"
"谢谢你所做的一切。\p"
"这是我的一点心意。\n"
"是装有潜水的秘传学习器。\p"
"不用客气——\n"
"这个秘传学习器是你应得的。$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_StevensHouse/scripts.inc:160
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_StevensHouse_Text_ExplainDive"
msgid ""
"STEVEN: While you're using SURF, you\n"
"should notice dark patches of water.\p"
"Use DIVE if you come to deep water\n"
"like it. You'll drop to the seafloor.\p"
"When you want to come back up, use\n"
"DIVE again.\p"
"In some places, it won't be possible\n"
"for you to surface, though.$"
msgstr ""
"大吾：使用冲浪的时候，\n"
"你应该会注意到颜色较深的海域。\p"
"如果遇到那样的深水，\n"
"就使用潜水。你会潜到海底。\p"
"想回到海面上的时候，\n"
"再使用一次潜水就行了。\p"
"不过，有些地方\n"
"是没办法浮上海面的。$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_StevensHouse/scripts.inc:170
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_StevensHouse_Text_UnderwateCavernBetweenMossdeepSootopolis"
msgid ""
"STEVEN: Apparently, there's an\n"
"underwater cavern between\l"
"MOSSDEEP and SOOTOPOLIS.\p"
"You know, the one that CAPT. STERN\n"
"found in his submarine.$"
msgstr ""
"大吾：听说在绿岭市和琉璃市\n"
"之间有一个海底洞窟。\p"
"你知道的，就是楠木船长\n"
"乘潜水艇发现的那个。$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_StevensHouse/scripts.inc:177
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_StevensHouse_Text_TakeBallContainingBeldum"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} checked the POKé BALL.\p"
"It contained the POKéMON\n"
"BELDUM.\p"
"Take the POKé BALL?$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}查看了精灵球。\p"
"里面装着宝可梦\n"
"铁哑铃。\p"
"要拿走精灵球吗？$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_StevensHouse/scripts.inc:183
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_StevensHouse_Text_ObtainedBeldum"
msgid "{PLAYER} obtained a BELDUM.$"
msgstr "{PLAYER}得到了铁哑铃。$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_StevensHouse/scripts.inc:187
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_StevensHouse_Text_NoSpaceForAnotherMon"
msgid "There is no space for another POKéMON.$"
msgstr "已经没有空间放更多宝可梦了。$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_StevensHouse/scripts.inc:190
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_StevensHouse_Text_LeftPokeBallWhereItWas"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} left the POKé BALL where\n"
"it was.$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}把精灵球\n"
"留在了原处。$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_StevensHouse/scripts.inc:194
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_StevensHouse_Text_LetterFromSteven"
msgid ""
"It's a letter.\p"
"… … … … … …\p"
"To {PLAYER}{KUN}…\p"
"I've decided to do a little soul-\n"
"searching and train on the road.\p"
"I don't plan to return home for some\n"
"time.\p"
"I have a favor to ask of you.\p"
"I want you to take the POKé BALL on\n"
"the desk.\p"
"Inside it is a BELDUM, my favorite\n"
"POKéMON.\p"
"I'm counting on you.\p"
"May our paths cross someday.\p"
"STEVEN STONE$"
msgstr ""
"是一封信。\p"
"…… …… ……\p"
"致{PLAYER}{KUN}……\p"
"我决定在旅途中修行，\n"
"好好审视一下自己。\p"
"暂时不打算回家了。\p"
"我有一件事想拜托你。\p"
"请你收下桌上的精灵球。\p"
"里面是我最喜欢的宝可梦\n"
"铁哑铃。\p"
"就拜托你了。\p"
"希望有一天我们能再次相遇。\p"
"大吾$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_StevensHouse/scripts.inc:211
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_StevensHouse_Text_CollectionOfRareRocks"
msgid ""
"It's a collection of rare rocks and\n"
"stones assembled by STEVEN.$"
msgstr ""
"这是大吾收集的\n"
"珍稀岩石和石头。$"
